  "title": "Cassata Cake",
  "description": "Cassata cake is a classic Italian layered cake with a creamy ricotta filling flavored with chocolate and candied lemon that's perfect for any celebration.",
  "authors": [
    "Kevin Ryan"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-06-09T14:00:55-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-05-19T08:10:54-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT30M",
  "cook_time": "PT30M",
  "total_time": "PT300M",
  "yield": [
    "14",
    "1 (2-layer) 9-inch cake"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Dessert"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "Italian"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "Italian"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups cake flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "5 eggs",
    "0.5 cup cold water",
    "1.25 cups white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.5 teaspoon cream of tartar",
    "2 pounds whole milk ricotta cheese",
    "2.25 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1.5 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "2 (1 ounce) squares semi-sweet chocolate",
    "0.5 cup candied lemon peel",
    "0.33333298563957 cup white sugar",
    "0.25 cup water",
    "2 tablespoons light rum",
    "6 (1 ounce) squares bittersweet chocolate, chopped",
    "0.33333298563957 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "3 tablespoons unsalted butter, cubed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Grease and line two 9-inch round cake pans with parchment paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PNq2ATib84kOmqPjcH4pBOG7OJ0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7682-cassata-cake-VAT-step-01-ff7ec6a970e64b17a5da2e3a1d631556.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7682/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift flour, baking powder, and salt together in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/slVe6qfGUYlOr5yXPzGRLAlLCWA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7682-cassata-cake-VAT-step-02-80cc773cb3c14f7a8575037a0c3dc6f1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7682/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Separate the eggs and set egg whites aside. Beat egg yolks together on medium-high speed until very thick, about 4 minutes. Gradually add ½ cup of cold water. Add 1 ¼ cups of white sugar, slowly, and beat well for about 3 more minutes. Add 1 teaspoon of vanilla. Add flour mixture to egg yolk mixture and fold in.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xqywr9UtPlXVtDkBQk26p8MhfWQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7682-cassata-cake-VAT-step-03-c5714214e46d4e88b6e8469925920559.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7682/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat egg whites and cream of tartar together until stiff peaks form. Fold into egg yolk mixture; divide the cake batter between the prepared pans.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6Sa2_YSRuuvoYZFNkce0KF9LUio=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7682-cassata-cake-VAT-step-04-7662f491730e409cac4729a32173c73d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7682/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake cakes in the preheated oven for 25 minutes. Cool on wire rack for 10 minutes; invert and cool completely. While the cakes are cooling, you can make the ricotta filling and rum syrup.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3YJmPTOmoMmztsG1YEcr53C6Xtc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7682-cassata-cake-VAT-step-05-c1b713665ecd4aef92af99d9eecd1ef2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7682/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the ricotta filling: Beat ricotta cheese well and add confectioner's sugar and cinnamon. Add 1 ½ teaspoons of vanilla and 2 ounces of grated chocolate. Stir in candied lemon peel and mix. Chill filling until ready to use.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xD6yLhm05RbfXXIy1MpOCtA8laQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7682-cassata-cake-VAT-step-06-e327241ca6984fc4aa4b8a5a8a466227.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7682/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the rum syrup: Place 1/3 cup of sugar and water in a small saucepan. Bring to a boil over medium heat, stirring to dissolve sugar. Boil 1 minute and then remove from heat and add rum. Cool syrup to room temperature.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/90vRuPVcseEPBy8sAUC87MJwXf8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7682-cassata-cake-VAT-step-07-72f844559b1d497489191ca663d4ac08.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7682/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut each cooled cake in half. Place one of the 4 halves on a cake board or plate and sprinkle with a little of the rum syrup.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zSeyMfl1GJy60-hnJYZ1-i-11Rk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7682-cassata-cake-VAT-step-08-daf4a80a6199486c88f602e825ecd8a3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7682/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread 1 ½ cups of the filling over this layer. Add a second layer of cake and repeat this procedure. Top the cake with the remaining piece of cake. Chill cake in the refrigerator for at least 4 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Bl-BLRL6dNOb3jr9wWtzzhVhByo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7682-cassata-cake-VAT-step-09-9cd517418ffa4004bd8391ad06b2d8c6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7682/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the chocolate glaze: Melt 6 ounces of chocolate and cream together in a microwave-safe bowl in the microwave; whisk until smooth. Add butter and whisk until dissolved. Cool mixture until spreadable.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/F3GLnJWoAjGYcyLpbpUmMaIZ1l4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7682-cassata-cake-VAT-step-10-be6a101aa1f545f9b28937215fcdab93.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7682/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread over the top of the chilled cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_5KjC-b4Vt-fB6WJFomijt5O6TM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-7682-cassata-cake-VAT-step-11-61540dea807245ae951fea73e2e8d6cf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/7682/step_11.webp"
    }
  ],
